<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Bed Bath &amp; Beyond cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Bed Bath &amp; Beyond cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Amy Ryan has cut her rating for Bed Bath &amp; Beyond Inc to hold from buy, a source at the brokerage said Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Springfield, N.J., home furnishings retailer closed Tuesday at 28-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
